# Cloudflare Pages: security headers for every page of revelaslides.com.
# (No X-Frame-Options: shared presentations may be embedded in other sites, such as Moodle.)
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
